(1)  253/   18DF2 :                     ; These data tables work in the following format.
(1)  254/   18DF2 :                     ; The first word gives the length of the teleporter's data in # of bytes.
(1)  255/   18DF2 :                     ; Every following word-length value is a pair, noting target coordinates.
(1)  256/   18DF2 :                     
