(1)  318/   191DC :                     
(1)  319/   191DC :                     		; Each sub-object deletes itself when it detects that its
(1)  320/   191DC :                     		; parent is going to delete itself. This mostly works, but
(1)  321/   191DC :                     		; does cause the sub-object to linger for one frame longer
(1)  322/   191DC :                     		; than it should, which is why rolling into a Caterkiller
(1)  323/   191DC :                     		; at high speed causes Sonic to be hurt.
(1)  324/   191DC :                     
(1)  325/   191DC :                     		; Has the head been destroyed?
(1)  326/   191DC : (MACRO)              		_cmpi.b	#id_ExplosionItem,obID(a1)
